  destinations:
  - destinationName: Savannah
    description: 'Golden grasslands stretch endlessly beneath the warm African sun.

      Gentle
      breezes ripple across the open plains as wildlife roams freely.

      Keep
      exploring to uncover hidden paths and exciting discoveries.

      Every journey
      brings you closer to the heart of the wild.'
    background: {fileID: -6700081171296591153, guid: 54f7c36de43a64e92be1a82a5717598d, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Elephant
    description: 'Follow the footsteps of majestic elephants through ancient migration
      routes.

      Towering trees and peaceful watering spots line the dusty trail.

      Hidden
      treasures await explorers who stay curious.

      Every path tells a story
      of the giants who came before.'
    background: {fileID: 6510215769898828853, guid: 9ace31c4a639c48f18749e33d003ca71, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Waterhole
    description: 'A refreshing oasis attracts animals from every corner of the plains.

      Watch
      nature gather beneath the bright blue sky.

      Explore the surrounding landscape
      to uncover exciting surprises.

      Adventure flourishes wherever life comes
      together.'
    background: {fileID: 7866509802124034278, guid: d5b768b6d51c94daea7cec1a3bc4e464, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Acacia Plains
    description: 'Umbrella-shaped acacia trees stand proudly across the endless savannah.

      Warm
      sunlight paints the landscape with golden beauty.

      Discover hidden routes
      winding through peaceful grasslands.

      Nature''s wonders await beyond
      every horizon.'
    background: {fileID: -8391632891642230533, guid: f8311b569509c4a0294779908d55541e, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Golden Grassland
    description: 'Rolling fields of golden grass shimmer beneath the afternoon sun.

      Gentle
      winds create waves across the vast open landscape.

      Search every corner
      for treasures hidden among the tall grasses.

      Every adventure feels larger
      than life.'
    background: {fileID: 527522180080246753, guid: 489ea0a4bc7b04e35abccfce33481065, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Sunset Rock
    description: 'Climb towering rock formations overlooking the glowing evening
      sky.

      The setting sun fills the horizon with brilliant shades of orange.

      Explore
      hidden ledges and secret pathways nearby.

      Every sunset marks another
      unforgettable adventure.'
    background: {fileID: 7407278298525031083, guid: 0e77031dd7af0478686db0b667c0bf32, type: 3}
